OL,3,GNEWSAWartime evacuee reunited with
OL,4,Abeloved Sunbeam car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA wartime evacuee has spoken of his
OL,7,Fdelight at being reunited with a car
OL,8,Fthat captured his imagination more than
OL,9,F80 years ago.
OL,11,FMike Thrift, 90, clearly remembers the
OL,12,Fday in 1941 when, as a five-year-old,
OL,13,Fhe was driven in the 1928 Sunbeam from
OL,14,Fa school hall in Nottingham to his
OL,15,Flodgings at a nearby manor house.
OL,17,FThe reunion came about after Thrift
OL,18,Fshared his memories of the car and his
OL,19,Ftime as an evacuee with his grandsons
OL,20,Fand daughter Mel, who live in
OL,21,FAustralia.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
